sections/product-full-width.liquid:
{% assign collection_handles = product.collections | map: 'handle' %}
{% assign variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant %}
{% assign product_tags = product.tags | join: ' ' %}

{% assign ville = product.metafields.accentuate.ville %}
{% assign departement = product.metafields.accentuate.departement %}
{% assign region = product.metafields.accentuate.region %}

{%- comment -%}
  Garde anti-404 sur les badges de lieu. accentuate.region / .departement sont
  des champs texte libres : un handleize ne garantit pas qu'une collection porte
  ce handle (« Province de Hainaut » -> aucune collection ;
  « Provence-Alpes-Cote d'Azur » -> provence-alpes-cote-d-azur alors que la
  collection est provence-alpes-cote-azur). loven-geo-url ne rend une URL que si
  une collection existe et contient des produits ; sinon le badge reste affiche,
  sans lien.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture villeUrl -%}{%- render 'loven-geo-url', label: ville, product: product -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture departementUrl -%}{%- render 'loven-geo-url', label: departement, product: product -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture regionUrl -%}{%- render 'loven-geo-url', label: region, product: product -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign villeUrl = villeUrl | strip -%}
{%- assign departementUrl = departementUrl | strip -%}
{%- assign regionUrl = regionUrl | strip -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Réservable en ligne = accentuate.ical_id contient une URL d'embed exploitable.
  Le metafield peut exister tout en étant inutilisable (chaîne vide, espaces,
  "null", "[]" selon le type Accentuate) : on exige une URL absolue, sinon
  AUCUN élément de réservation n'est rendu.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign ical_url = product.metafields.accentuate.ical_id | strip
  assign has_calendar = false
  if ical_url contains '://'
    assign has_calendar = true
  endif
  comment
    Fiche non partenaire (template produit-churn) :
    jamais de reservation, meme si ical_id est encore renseigne.
  endcomment
  assign is_churn = false
  if product.template_suffix == 'produit-churn'
    assign is_churn = true
    assign has_calendar = false
  endif
-%}



{%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}

  {%- capture loven_v2 -%}{%- render 'loven-booking-actif', product: product -%}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign loven_v2 = loven_v2 | strip -%}
  <div class="page-width loven-product">
    <div class="loven-product__grid grid">
    <div class="loven-product__main grid__item medium-up--two-thirds small--one-whole">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- case block.type -%}
          {%  when 'calendar' %}
            {% if has_calendar %}
              <div class="product-block medium-up--hide loven-product-book" id="calendar">
                <div class="loven-product-book__head">
                  {%- render 'loven-product-reviews', product: product -%}
                  {%- unless loven_v2 == 'true' -%}
                    {%- render 'loven-product-price', product: product, modifier: 'sidebar' -%}
                    {%- render 'loven-product-reassurance' -%}
                  {%- endunless -%}
                </div>
                {%- render 'loven-product-dates', product: product -%}
              </div>
            {% elsif is_churn == false %}
              {%- comment -%}
                Sans calendrier, la colonne de droite est masquee sur mobile
                (small--hide) : sans ce bloc, le visiteur mobile n'aurait aucun
                chemin de reservation. On lui rend le CTA de repli (site,
                telephone ou message selon ce que l'hebergeur a renseigne),
                sans le bandeau avis/prix du cas reservable. Le snippet ne rend
                rien s'il n'a aucun de ces trois moyens.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              <div class="product-block medium-up--hide" id="calendar">
                {%- render 'loven-book-external', product: product -%}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          {%  when 'last-minute' %}
            {%- render 'loven-last-minute', product: product -%}
          {%  when 'CTAs' %}
              {%- comment -%}
                Le bouton « Envoyer un message » a demenage dans l'encart
                proprietaire (loven-product-host), au 05/09/2026 : un seul point
                de contact, place a cote du visage de l'hote et de la mention de
                securite. Ce bloc reste declare pour ne pas casser les sections
                deja configurees dans l'editeur de theme.
              {%- endcomment -%}
          {%  when 'titre' %}
              <div class="loven-product__identity">
              {%- if has_calendar or region != blank or departement != blank or product.metafields.accentuate.certified_host -%}
                <div class="loven-product__badges">
                  {%- if has_calendar -%}
                    <span class="loven-product__badge loven-product__badge--bookable">{{ 'products.hybrid.bookable_online' | t }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- if region != blank -%}
                    {%- if regionUrl != blank -%}
                      <a class="loven-product__badge loven-product__badge--place" href="{{ regionUrl }}" title="Week-end amoureux en {{ region }}">{{ region }}</a>
                    {%- else -%}
                      <span class="loven-product__badge loven-product__badge--place">{{ region }}</span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- if departement != blank -%}
                    {%- if departementUrl != blank -%}
                      <a class="loven-product__badge loven-product__badge--place" href="{{ departementUrl }}" title="Nuit d'amour à {{ departement }}">{{ departement }}</a>
                    {%- else -%}
                      <span class="loven-product__badge loven-product__badge--place">{{ departement }}</span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- if product.metafields.accentuate.certified_host -%}
                    <span class="loven-product__badge loven-product__badge--certified">{{ 'products.hybrid.certified_host' | t }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
              <h1 class="h1 product-single__title">
                {{ product.title }}
              </h1>
              {%- render 'loven-spicyness', product: product, variant: 'product' -%}
              {%- if is_churn -%}
                <div class="medium-up--hide">
                  {%- render 'loven-churn-notice', product: product -%}
                </div>
              {%- elsif has_calendar == false -%}
                <div class="medium-up--hide">
                  {%- render 'loven-product-reviews', product: product -%}
                  {%- render 'loven-product-price', product: product, modifier: 'sidebar' -%}
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
              </div>
            {% when 'offre' %}
              {%- if product.metafields.custom.texte_offre != blank -%}
                <div class="product-block">
                  {% render 'product-offer' %}
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
        {%- when '@app' -%}
          {%- unless block.id contains 'preview_badge' -%}
            <div class="product-block">
              {% render block %}
            </div>
          {%- endunless -%}
          {%- when 'share' -%}
            <div class="product-block" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              {%- render 'social-sharing',
                share_title: product.title,
                share_permalink: product.url,
                share_image: product
              -%}
            </div>
         {%- when 'separator' -%}
            <div class="product-block"><hr></div>  
        {%- when 'text' -%}
          <div {{ block.shopify_attributes }} class="product-block">
            {{ block.settings.text }}
          </div>
        {%- when 'tab' -%}
          <div class="product-block product-block--tab" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            {% assign tab_id = block.id | append: product.id %}
            {% capture tab_content %}
            {{ block.settings.content }}
            {{ block.settings.page.content }}
          {% endcapture %}
            {%- render 'tab', id: tab_id, title: block.settings.title, content: tab_content -%}
          </div>
        {%  when 'details' %}
          {%- render 'loven-product-practical', product: product -%}
        {%- when 'faq' -%}
          {%- render 'loven-product-faq', product: product, section_id: section.id -%}
        {%- when 'klarna' -%}
          {%- if has_calendar == false -%}
            <div class="product-block medium-up--hide" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              {%- render 'loven-product-reassurance', product: product -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- when 'contact' -%}
          <div class="product-block product-block--tab" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            {% assign tab_id = block.id | append: product.id %}
            {%- render 'tab-contact', id: tab_id, block: block -%}
          </div>
          {%- when 'description' -%}
            <div class="product-block loven-product__description">
              {%  render 'readmore', content:product.description %}
            </div>


          {% when 'equipment' %}
            <div class="product-block loven-product__equipments">
            {% render 'equipments-list', featured_limit: 6 %}
            </div>
          {%- when 'custom' -%}
            <div class="product-block" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              {{ block.settings.code }}
            </div>
      {%  when 'certified' %}
        {%  if  product.metafields.accentuate.certified_host %}
          <div class="certified__container">
          <div class="certified__icon">
          <svg class="icon" fill="none" height="512" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g fill="#FC3A4A"><path d="m15.8789 9.4771c.2634-.48538.0836-1.09246-.4018-1.35595s-1.0925-.08361-1.3559.40177l-2.6393 4.86168-1.79796-1.6856c-.40291-.3777-1.03574-.3573-1.41347.0456-.37773.403-.35732 1.0358.04559 1.4135l2.74284 2.5714c.2261.212.5376.3071.8434.2577.3059-.0494.5716-.2378.7194-.5101z"/><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="m14.7806 3.31971c-1.4362-1.75961-4.125-1.75961-5.56117 0-.33751.41353-.86009.62999-1.39116.57624-2.25974-.22873-4.16105 1.67258-3.93232 3.93232.05375.53107-.16271 1.05365-.57624 1.39116-1.75961 1.43617-1.75961 4.12497 0 5.56117.41353.3375.62999.8601.57624 1.3911-.22873 2.2598 1.67258 4.1611 3.93232 3.9324.53107-.0538 1.05365.1627 1.39116.5762 1.43617 1.7596 4.12497 1.7596 5.56117 0 .3375-.4135.8601-.63 1.3911-.5762 2.2598.2287 4.1611-1.6726 3.9324-3.9324-.0538-.531.1627-1.0536.5762-1.3911 1.7596-1.4362 1.7596-4.125 0-5.56117-.4135-.33751-.63-.86009-.5762-1.39116.2287-2.25974-1.6726-4.16105-3.9324-3.93232-.531.05375-1.0536-.16271-1.3911-.57624zm-4.0117 1.26461c.6358-.77909 1.8264-.77909 2.4622 0 .7623.93398 1.9426 1.42287 3.142 1.30146 1.0006-.10127 1.8424.74055 1.7411 1.74108-.1214 1.19945.3675 2.37974 1.3015 3.14204.7791.6358.7791 1.8264 0 2.4622-.934.7623-1.4229 1.9426-1.3015 3.142.1013 1.0006-.7405 1.8424-1.7411 1.7411-1.1994-.1214-2.3797.3675-3.142 1.3015-.6358.7791-1.8264.7791-2.4622 0-.7623-.934-1.94259-1.4229-3.14204-1.3015-1.00053.1013-1.84235-.7405-1.74108-1.7411.12141-1.1994-.36748-2.3797-1.30146-3.142-.77909-.6358-.77909-1.8264 0-2.4622.93398-.7623 1.42287-1.94259 1.30146-3.14204-.10127-1.00053.74055-1.84235 1.74108-1.74108 1.19945.12141 2.37974-.36748 3.14204-1.30146z" fill-rule="evenodd"/></g></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="certified__text">
          <strong>Hôte Certifié</strong><br><p>Cette room a été sélectionnée pour la qualité de ses services et la satisfaction des clients</p>
          </div>
          </div>
      {%  endif %}
        {%- endcase -%}

      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
    <div class="loven-product__aside grid__item medium-up--one-third small--hide">
      {%- if is_churn -%}
        {%- render 'loven-churn-notice', product: product -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {%- render 'loven-product-sidebar', product: product -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
    </div>
    {%- unless is_churn -%}
      {%- render 'loven-product-sticky-bar', product: product -%}
      {%- if product.metafields.accentuate.email -%}
        {%- render 'message-form', hide_button: true -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endunless -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

